<title>SPAIN: FORECAST - BBV Q3 profit to rise 25.6 pct.</title>
<headline>FORECAST - BBV Q3 profit to rise 25.6 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following is a consensus of analyst forecasts for BBV 1996 third quarter results. (billions of pesetas unless stated):</p>
<p> BBV				 Q3 1996   Q3 1995	 RANGE</p>
<p>   Net attributable		69.96     55.69   68.00 -  72.14</p>
<p>   Net interest income	  301.43    242.09  297.11 - 305.10</p>
<p>   Operating margin	     168.55    117.98  165.08 - 171.60</p>
<p>CONTRIBUTORS: Benito y Monjardin, AB Asesores, BSN, Ahorro Corporacion, AB Asesores and ABN AMRO.</p>
<p>NOTE: BBV will announce 1996 3Q results on Oct 21.</p>
</text>
